    "text": "Oklahoma\n2025 KTEN Oklahoma High School Football Preview Show\nBy Adam Ogburn, KTEN Sports,\n2 hours agoARDMORE, Oklahoma (KTEN)- KTEN's 2025 Oklahoma High School Football Preview Show checks in with all 25 Oklahoma teams in the Texoma viewing area plus KTEN Sports reporter Brigg Bates goes one-on-one with Ardmore head coach Josh Newby. Run Order:. Ada. Madill. Plainview. Pauls Valley. Hugo. Dickson. Atoka. Antlers. Tishomingo. Healdton.",
